<p>A spring cleaning checklist works best room by room and top to bottom: declutter first, dust the high areas, clean surfaces and fittings, then finish with the floors. Start with the rooms that collect the most winter grime, usually the kitchen and bathroom, and save the easier rooms for last.</p>
