<li>Pull out appliances where it's safe and clean behind and underneath</li>
<li>Wipe light switches, sockets and skirting boards</li>
<li>Wash the kitchen bin inside and out</li>
<li>Mop the floor, getting right into the corners and along the kickboards</li>
</ul>
<p>The oven is often the toughest job of the whole spring clean. Our <a href="{{service:oven-cleaning}}">oven cleaning</a> uses fume-free, non-caustic products, and our <a href="{{guide:kitchen-deep-clean-checklist}}">kitchen deep clean checklist</a> covers each step in more depth.</p>
