<p>Sofas take a lot of punishment over winter. Our <a href="{{guide:sofa-upholstery-cleaning-guide}}">sofa and upholstery cleaning guide</a> explains how to read fabric care codes before you try anything wet.</p>
<h2>Bedroom spring cleaning checklist</h2>
<ul>
<li>Swap heavy winter bedding for lighter covers, and wash duvets and pillows (check the care labels, or use a launderette for large items)</li>
<li>Hoover the mattress and turn or rotate it if the manufacturer recommends it</li>
<li>Hoover under the bed and behind furniture</li>
<li>Sort wardrobes and drawers and pack away winter clothes</li>
<li>Dust the tops of wardrobes, headboards and light fittings</li>
<li>Check window reveals and the backs of wardrobes on outside walls for mould</li>
<li>Clean windows, sills and blinds</li>
<li>Wipe skirting boards, doors and switches</li>
</ul>
<p>Spring is also when pollen arrives. If anyone in your home has hay fever or asthma, our guide to <a href="{{guide:cleaning-for-allergies}}">cleaning for allergies</a> covers bedding, dust mites and keeping pollen out.</p>
<h2>Hallways, stairs and the rest of the house</h2>
<ul>
<li>Wipe the front and back doors, letterbox, handles and doorbell</li>
<li>Clean the stair spindles, handrail and the edges of each stair</li>
<li>Shake out or wash doormats</li>
<li>Sort out the coat and shoe area</li>
<li>Dust radiators and clean behind them with a radiator brush</li>
<li>Gently clean smoke alarms with a hoover brush attachment, then test them</li>
<li>Wipe the outside of the wheelie bins and sweep the bin area before bin day</li>
</ul>
<div class="cc-callout"><p><strong>Tip:</strong> Winter condensation often leaves black spots on window frames and in the corners of north-facing rooms, especially in older terraces. Clean them as part of your spring clean and look at the cause too; our guide to <a href="{{guide:damp-and-mould-in-older-homes}}">damp and mould in older homes</a> explains what to do.</p></div>
<h2>Getting help with your spring clean</h2>
<p>Spring cleaning a whole house is a big job, and it's fine to hand some or all of it over. Our team carries out spring deep cleans across <a href="{{area:hull}}">Hull</a> and East Yorkshire, bringing all the equipment and products, with eco-friendly products available on request. We can also add <a href="{{service:carpet-upholstery-cleaning}}">carpet and upholstery cleaning</a>, using hot water extraction to lift the dirt that winter has trodden in.</p>
<p>See what's covered in our <a href="{{service:deep-cleaning}}">deep cleaning service</a>, and <a href="{{page:contact}}">get in touch</a> for a fixed quote, agreed before any work starts.</p>
