		'faqs'        => [
			[ 'Where should I start spring cleaning?', 'Start by decluttering, then tackle the kitchen and bathroom first, as they collect the most grease, limescale and mould over winter. Work top to bottom in each room and finish with the floors.' ],
			[ 'How long does spring cleaning take?', 'For a typical family home, spring cleaning on your own usually takes several days or a couple of weekends. A professional team can often complete a full deep clean in a day.' ],
			[ 'When should you spring clean?', 'Any time from March to May works well, once the heating is going off and you can open the windows. The exact timing matters less than doing it once a year.' ],
